[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) circle (1.6);
\draw (-1.6,0) arc (180:360:1.6 and 0.5);
\draw[dashed] (1.6,0) arc (0:180:1.6 and 0.5);
\fill (0,0) circle (1.2pt);
\draw[-{Stealth}] (0,0)--(-35:1.6) node[midway,below right,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$6\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Find the surface area of this sphere in exact form, in terms of $\pi$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) circle (1.6);
\draw (-1.6,0) arc (180:360:1.6 and 0.5);
\draw[dashed] (1.6,0) arc (0:180:1.6 and 0.5);
\draw[{Stealth}-{Stealth}] (2.0,-1.6)--(2.0,1.6) node[midway,right] {$10\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
This sphere has a diameter of $10$ cm.
Find its surface area in exact form, in terms of $\pi$.
